  {
    "id": "stoll_ergotamine_isolation",
    "event_type": "invention",
    "label": "Isolation of ergotamine by Stoll",
    "date": {
      "display": "1918",
      "precision": "year",
      "sort_start": "1918-01-01",
      "sort_end": "1918-12-31"
    },
    "participants": [
      {
        "entity_id": "arthur_stoll",
        "role": "invention"
      },
      {
        "entity_id": "ergotamine",
        "role": "invention"
      }
    ],
    "sources": [
      {
        "source_id": "giger_engel_2006",
        "page": 1,
        "quote": "The scientific research on ergot alkaloids began in 1918 with the isolation of ergotamine (1) by A. Stoll [1], the first chemically pure ergot peptide alkaloid, which exhibits the pharmacological spectrum of action of the drug extracted from Claviceps purpurea, the dark violet sclerotia of the fungus that infects ears of rye (Fig. 2)."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "hofmann_ergobasin_proposal",
    "event_type": "other",
    "label": "Proposed synthesis of ergobasin",
    "date": {
      "display": "1935",
      "precision": "year",
      "sort_start": "1935-01-01",
      "sort_end": "1935-12-31"
    },
    "participants": [
      {
        "entity_id": "albert_hofmann",
        "role": "subject"
      },
      {
        "entity_id": "arthur_stoll",
        "role": "supervisor"
      }
    ],
    "sources": [
      {
        "source_id": "giger_engel_2006",
        "page": 2,
        "quote": "At this time Dr. Hofmann proposed to Prof. Stoll to attempt the partial synthesis of egobasin (2), seeking for a proof of structure and eventually a more effective production of this compound, which was present only in tiny amounts in ergot."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "hofmann_hydergine_development",
    "event_type": "invention",
    "label": "Catalytic hydrogenation of ergotoxine",
    "description": "Yielded Hydergine, a new medicine.",
    "date": {
      "display": "1943",
      "precision": "year",
      "sort_start": "1943-01-01",
      "sort_end": "1943-12-31"
    },
    "participants": [
      {
        "entity_id": "albert_hofmann",
        "role": "subject"
      },
      {
        "entity_id": "hydergine",
        "role": "invention"
      }
    ],
    "sources": [
      {
        "source_id": "giger_engel_2006",
        "page": 2,
        "quote": "In 1943 an important step in ergot research was the catalytic hydrogenation of ergotoxine (7) from natural sources by Hofmann, which was found to be a mixture of the four genuine peptide alkaloids ergocristine (8) (one third), ergocornine (9) (one third), α- and β-ergocryptine (10 and 11) (one third of a 2:1 mixture), and yielded a new medicine with the generic name ergoloid mesylate and the trade name Hydergine® (12) (Fig. 6) which is still widely used today [4][5]."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lysergic_acid_stereochemistry",
    "event_type": "other",
    "label": "Elucidation of lysergic acid stereochemistry",
    "date": {
      "display": "1949",
      "precision": "year",
      "sort_start": "1949-01-01",
      "sort_end": "1949-12-31"
    },
    "participants": [
      {
        "entity_id": "albert_hofmann",
        "role": "subject"
      },
      {
        "entity_id": "arthur_stoll",
        "role": "collaborator"
      },
      {
        "entity_id": "f_troxler",
        "role": "collaborator"
      }
    ],
    "sources": [
      {
        "source_id": "giger_engel_2006",
        "page": 2,
        "quote": "It is interesting to note that the structure of lysergic acid (3) was elucidated by Jacobs and his associates [6], its stereochemistry by Stoll, Hofmann and Troxler in 1949, and until the 1950s, i.e. before Stoll, Hofmann and their associates were able to elucidate the structure of the peptide portion of ergotamine [6], the chemical formula of ergot alkaloid merely indicated the degradation products of the peptide portion."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "hofmann_psilocybin_structure",
    "event_type": "other",
    "label": "Elucidated chemical structure of psilocybin",
    "date": {
      "display": "1958",
      "precision": "year",
      "sort_start": "1958-01-01",
      "sort_end": "1958-12-31"
    },
    "participants": [
